IUCA ADVANTAGES
- Academic freedom and integrity (no corrupt grading schemes)
- High-quality faculty: includes former Minister of Education, former Constitutional Court Judge, former Chairman of the National Bank of KR, former Advisor to the Prime Minister; foreign professors from USA, India, UK, Taiwan, China, Canada
- Person-centered approach: only university in Kyrgyzstan conducting regular study of cognitive and personal characteristics of each student using instruments from leading US universities
- Dual diploma: state diploma plus an American-style institutional diploma
- Exchange programs: active partnerships with USA, China, Russia, Kazakhstan, Lithuania, Norway; opportunities also in Germany, South Korea
- Small class sizes, modern campus facilities
- Intensive language programs in English and Chinese

